              "newText": "FOR THE AVOIDANCE OF DOUBT, THIS SECTION 15.11 IS NOT MEANT TO LIMIT PB'S OBLIGATION TO PAY SFJ THE AMOUNTS SET FORTH IN ARTICLE 6 OR SECTION 14.2. EXCEPT FOR EXCLUDED CLAIMS, EACH PARTY'S TOTAL AGGREGATE LIABILITY ARISING OUT OF OR RELATING TO THIS AGREEMENT WILL NOT EXCEED THE GREATER OF (A) THE AGGREGATE AMOUNTS PAID OR PAYABLE BY PB TO SFJ UNDER ARTICLE 6 IN THE TWELVE (12) MONTHS IMMEDIATELY PRECEDING THE EVENT GIVING RISE TO THE CLAIM AND (B) ONE MILLION DOLLARS USD ($1,000,000). \"EXCLUDED CLAIMS\" MEANS A PARTY'S BREACH OF ITS CONFIDENTIALITY OR DATA PROTECTION OBLIGATIONS UNDER ARTICLE 10 OR ARTICLE 11, ITS INDEMNIFICATION OBLIGATIONS UNDER ARTICLE 12, ITS GROSS NEGLIGENCE, WILLFUL MISCONDUCT OR FRAUD, ITS INFRINGEMENT OF THE OTHER PARTY'S INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY, AND ITS OBLIGATIONS TO MAKE PAYMENTS EXPRESSLY REQUIRED UNDER THIS AGREEMENT, INCLUDING PB'S OBLIGATIONS UNDER ARTICLE 6 AND SECTION 14.2 AND SFJ'S OBLIGATION TO FUND DEVELOPMENT COSTS UNDER ARTICLE 4."
